<title>USA: Alpine Group unit names North American head.</title>
<headline>Alpine Group unit names North American head.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Alpine Group Inc said Wednesday it named Norman Taylor to the newly-created position of president of the North American operations of its refractories unit, Refraco Inc.</p>
<p>Taylor was vice president of Premier Refractories Canada during 1997 and from 1994 to 1996 was president of Didier-North American Refractories, Alpine said.</p>
